{"title":"Career Roadmap · Sourcing Executive","role":"Sourcing Executive","summary":"A Sourcing Executive in the fashion and textile industry identifies suppliers, evaluates fabrics and trims, coordinates sampling and production requirements, negotiates commercial terms, monitors quality and timelines, and helps ensure that products are sourced at the right quality, cost, quantity, and delivery schedule.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc. (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Fashion Technology / Textile Science"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a Fashion Technology / Textile Science graduate, this is a strong business-technical career because it combines textile knowledge + supplier management + costing + quality + production + international sourcing."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical route:"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Sc. Fashion Technology/Textile Science → Sourcing/Merchandising Internship → Sourcing Executive → Senior Sourcing Executive → Sourcing Manager → Category/Supply Chain Manager → Head of Sourcing"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons: 2026–2046","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Stage","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2028"},{"text":"Student / Sourcing Intern"},{"text":"Textiles + sourcing fundamentals"}],[{"text":"2028–2030"},{"text":"Sourcing Executive"},{"text":"Supplier coordination + sampling"}],[{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Senior Sourcing Executive"},{"text":"Vendor development + costing"}],[{"text":"2033–2037"},{"text":"Sourcing Manager"},{"text":"Supplier portfolio + negotiations"}],[{"text":"2037–2042"},{"text":"Category / Supply Chain Manager"},{"text":"Strategic sourcing"}],[{"text":"2042–2046"},{"text":"Head of Sourcing / Procurement"},{"text":"Global sourcing strategy"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Key Skills","Proof"],"rows